{"4371220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ash Dawn", "steam_appid": 4371220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/6351b60975082780c1586d604af8576d.poster.avif?t=1788257492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/6351b60975082780c1586d604af8576d.webm?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/6351b60975082780c1586d604af8576d.mp4?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action Packed Bullet-hell combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run into true life and death situations with bullets flying everywhere, and only your wits and reflexes to keep you safe (and maybe your gear too). Experience unique hand crafted patterns and bosses armed to the teeth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/dcf02d6c1bbccd233b312ae85bae1103.poster.avif?t=1788257492\" width=1170 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/dcf02d6c1bbccd233b312ae85bae1103.webm?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/dcf02d6c1bbccd233b312ae85bae1103.mp4?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick from 8 classes </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a class to suit your play style. With various abilities including high damage attacks, healing, buffing/ debuffing, summoning, shape-shifting and much more. Each character has unique talents choices and gearing options  letting you customize your experience even more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/54448e17244b5b8331da4adaaa5629ca.poster.avif?t=1788257492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/54448e17244b5b8331da4adaaa5629ca.webm?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/54448e17244b5b8331da4adaaa5629ca.mp4?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play alone or with others</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends to join you on a quest or try something that can be done alone. Or step into a world with others and see how that goes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/fe7dd70c07611daec05a57e19a71ad2c.poster.avif?t=1788257492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/fe7dd70c07611daec05a57e19a71ad2c.webm?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/fe7dd70c07611daec05a57e19a71ad2c.mp4?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose different scenarios </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Ash Dawn is separated into different scenarios each with their own rules. Which scenario you pick will decide your goals, what challenges you'll face and how many people can join you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Story-focused mode: Your character lives and dies in the scenario. There is story playing out and you have a limited time to fulfill your goals. it is designed to end after a certain amount of time, giving you freedom to influence the world as you want before the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-MMO mode, Join open scenarios available to everyone with characters you can keep (as long as they don't die). Gear up and become stronger and maybe one day you'll be able to beat the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/de2c8b89a9bcf99fb03bca8af4e0d772.poster.avif?t=1788257492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/de2c8b89a9bcf99fb03bca8af4e0d772.webm?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/de2c8b89a9bcf99fb03bca8af4e0d772.mp4?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seamless multilayered world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is connected. There are no loading screens or times in-game. Whether you are going into buildings, up towers or deep into caves, everything is smooth and seamless. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/07e110f4075b969c3fe26dc85e6aafb1.poster.avif?t=1788257492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/07e110f4075b969c3fe26dc85e6aafb1.webm?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/07e110f4075b969c3fe26dc85e6aafb1.mp4?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of unique items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather powerful items from slaying monsters and trading with others.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/6351b60975082780c1586d604af8576d.poster.avif?t=1788257492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/6351b60975082780c1586d604af8576d.webm?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/6351b60975082780c1586d604af8576d.mp4?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action Packed Bullet-hell combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run into true life and death situations with bullets flying everywhere, and only your wits and reflexes to keep you safe (and maybe your gear too). Experience unique hand crafted patterns and bosses armed to the teeth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/dcf02d6c1bbccd233b312ae85bae1103.poster.avif?t=1788257492\" width=1170 height=1