p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is connected. There are no loading screens or times in-game. Whether you are going into buildings, up towers or deep into caves, everything is smooth and seamless. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/07e110f4075b969c3fe26dc85e6aafb1.poster.avif?t=1788257492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/07e110f4075b969c3fe26dc85e6aafb1.webm?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/extras/07e110f4075b969c3fe26dc85e6aafb1.mp4?t=1788257492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of unique items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather powerful items from slaying monsters and trading with others.</p>", "short_description": "Dodge or Die! You are out of potions.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/8bfca04eff41c4ef340f19f7048130e6a9abb025/header.jpg?t=1788257492", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/8407d7cef2191192a22b77de74f7530823000cda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788257492", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371220/8407d7cef2191192a22b77de74f7530823000cda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788257492", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5Ghz dual-core Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Open GL 3.